title: 1924 Legislative Elections
new-page: true
tags: event
priority: 1
view-if: year == 1924 and month == 4
on-arrival: {!
// Resetting basic election / coalition state for the two-party election
Q.in_election = 1;

// Clear previous coalition flags
Q.in_coalition = 0;
Q.in_unstable_coalition = 0;
Q.kmt_in_government = 0;
Q.cpc_in_government = 0;

// Ensure only KMT and CPC are present in the election (others set to zero)
Q.other_r = 0;
Q.other_seating = 0;
Q.other_seating_disp = 0;

// Make sure vote share variables exist; if not, default them
if (typeof Q.kmt_r === 'undefined') Q.kmt_r = 50.0;
if (typeof Q.cpc_r === 'undefined') Q.cpc_r = 50.0;

// Prevent instant dismissal / immediate follow-ups
Q.next_election_year = Q.next_election_year || year;
Q.next_election_month = Q.next_election_month || month;
!}
on-departure: week_actions += 1; in_election = 0; next_election_year = next_election_year + 2; n_elections += 1; next_election_time = time + 24;
set-jump: post_election_1924

= Elections, [+ month : month +] [+ year +]

The legislative elections are taking place now. Only two parties contest: the Kuomintang (KMT) and the Chinese Communist Party (CPC).

@post_election_1924
on-arrival: {!
// Save old vote shares
Q.old_kmt_r = Q.kmt_r || 0;
Q.old_cpc_r = Q.cpc_r || 0;

// Normalize if totals aren't exactly 100
var total_votes = (Q.kmt_r || 0) + (Q.cpc_r || 0) + (Q.other_r || 0);
if (total_votes === 0) {
    // default split if nothing set
    Q.kmt_r = 55;
    Q.cpc_r = 45;
    total_votes = Q.kmt_r + Q.cpc_r;
}
if (total_votes !== 100) {
    Q.kmt_r = (Q.kmt_r / total_votes) * 100;
    Q.cpc_r = (Q.cpc_r / total_votes) * 100;
    Q.other_r = 0;
}

// Set total seats for the chamber
var total_available_seats = 500;
Q.total_seats = total_available_seats;

// Calculate seats (round to nearest integer) and display percentages
Q.kmt_seating = Math.round((Q.kmt_r / 100) * total_available_seats);
Q.cpc_seating = Math.round((Q.cpc_r / 100) * total_available_seats);
Q.other_seating = 0;

// seating percentage (display)
Q.kmt_seating_disp = parseFloat(((Q.kmt_seating / total_available_seats) * 100).toFixed(1));
Q.cpc_seating_disp = parseFloat(((Q.cpc_seating / total_available_seats) * 100).toFixed(1));

// formatted vote share display
Q.kmt_r_disp = Q.kmt_r.toFixed(1);
Q.cpc_r_disp = Q.cpc_r.toFixed(1);

// changes since last election
Q.change_kmt_r = Q.kmt_r - (Q.old_kmt_r || 0);
Q.change_cpc_r = Q.cpc_r - (Q.old_cpc_r || 0);
Q.str_change_kmt = (Q.change_kmt_r >= 0 ? '+' : '') + Q.change_kmt_r.toFixed(1) + '%';
Q.str_change_cpc = (Q.change_cpc_r >= 0 ? '+' : '') + Q.change_cpc_r.toFixed(1) + '%';

// largest party
Q.largest_party = Q.kmt_r >= Q.cpc_r ? 'KMT' : 'CPC';

// store an election record
var election_result = {'date': new Date(Q.year, Q.month - 1), 'KMT': parseFloat(Q.kmt_r.toFixed(1)), 'CPC': parseFloat(Q.cpc_r.toFixed(1))};
Q.election_records = Q.election_records || [];
Q.election_records.push(election_result);
!}
on-display: {!
data = [
    {
        "id": "kmt",
        "legend": "KMT",
        "name": "Kuomintang",
        "seats": Math.round(Q.kmt_seating)
    },
    {
        "id": "cpc",
        "legend": "CPC",
        "name": "Communist Party",
        "seats": Math.round(Q.cpc_seating)
    }
];

if (window && d3) {
    var width = 500;
    var height = 500;
    var screenWidth = document.getElementById('content').offsetWidth;
    if (screenWidth < width - 50) {
        width = screenWidth - 50;
        height = width;
        document.getElementById("chamber").style.height = screenWidth/2 + "px";
    }

    var parliament = d3.parliament();
    parliament.width(width).height(height).innerRadiusCoef(0.4);
    parliament.enter.fromCenter(true).smallToBig(true);
    parliament.exit.toCenter(false).bigToSmall(true);
    d3.select("#chamber").datum(data).call(parliament);
}
!}
go-to: coalition_menu

= Election results

{!<svg id="chamber" style="width: 500px; height: 250px;"> </svg>!}

{!<table>!}
{!<tr><td>Party</td><td>Vote Share</td><td>Change</td><td>Seats</td><td>% Seats</td></tr>!}
{!<tr><td><div class="box" style='background-color:#1E90FF'> </div>!} Kuomintang (KMT) {!</td><td>!} **[+ kmt_r_disp +]%** {!</td><td>!} [+ str_change_kmt +] {!</td><td>!} [+ kmt_seating +] {!</td><td>!} [+ kmt_seating_disp +]% {!</td></tr>!}
{!<tr><td><div class="box" style='background-color:#D80027'> </div>!} Communist Party (CPC) {!</td><td>!} **[+ cpc_r_disp +]%** {!</td><td>!} [+ str_change_cpc +] {!</td><td>!} [+ cpc_seating +] {!</td><td>!} [+ cpc_seating_disp +]% {!</td></tr>!}
{!</table>!}

**Summary:** The largest party is: [+ largest_party +].

There are a few possible outcomes.

@coalition_menu
on-arrival: {!
Q.in_coalition = 0;
Q.kmt_in_government = 0;
Q.cpc_in_government = 0;
!}

- @kmt_majority
- @cpc_majority
- @no_action

@kmt_majority
title: KMT majority
subtitle: KMT: [+ kmt_seating_disp +]%
view-if: kmt_seating_disp >= 50
on-arrival: {!
Q.prime_minister_party = "KMT";
Q.prime_minister = Q.kmt_leader || "KMT Leader";
Q.kmt_in_government = 1;
!}

The Kuomintang have secured a majority and will form the government.

@cpc_majority
title: CPC majority
subtitle: CPC: [+ cpc_seating_disp +]%
view-if: cpc_seating_disp >= 50
on-arrival: {!
Q.prime_minister_party = "CPC";
Q.prime_minister = Q.cpc_leader || "CPC Leader";
Q.cpc_in_government = 1;
!}

The CPC has come out on top and will lead the new government.

@no_action
title: No immediate action
subtitle: No majority
view-if: kmt_seating_disp < 50 and cpc_seating_disp < 50
on-arrival: {!
Q.in_unstable_coalition = 1;
!}

Neither party achieved an outright majority. 
